Rewrite a .kash file in canonical layout (whitespace only)

Usage: kashika fmt [OPTIONS] <FILE>

Arguments:
  <FILE>  The .kash file to format, or `-` to format stdin to stdout

Options:
      --check                    Exit 1 if the file is not formatted, without rewriting it
      --stdin-name <STDIN_NAME>  File name to report for stdin input
  -h, --help                     Print help
